	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h1 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Our Story</strong></h1>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper "  >
	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1024" height="683" src="https://krisala.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IMG_3847-new-1024x683.jpg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large" alt="Krisala Developers Family" title="IMG_3847 new" srcset="https://krisala.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IMG_3847-new-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://krisala.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IMG_3847-new-300x200.jpg 300w, https://krisala.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IMG_3847-new-768x512.jpg 768w, https://krisala.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IMG_3847-new-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://krisala.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IMG_3847-new-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://krisala.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IMG_3847-new-750x499.jpg 750w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper "  >
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h2 style="text-align: left;">Team Krisala</h2>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p data-start="0" data-end="266">With 14+ years of extensive experience, delivering superior quality homes and innovative construction solutions, Krisala Developers have created a name to be reckoned with for trust and excellence. At Krisala, customer comfort and trust remain the foremost priority.</p>
<p data-start="268" data-end="633" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Krisala has fast grown into a preferred developer through transparency and consistency in fulfilling its commitments. With over 10 M+ Sq. Ft. Area Under Development across Integrated Townships, Plotted Developments, Redevelopment, Residential, and Commercial projects, Krisala Developers is all set to surpass many milestones ahead. Come and join us in our success.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
			
