        <div class="team-desc">
            <h3>Mr. Aakash Agarwal</h3>
            <p class="lead">Managing Director</p>            <div class="small-border"></div>
            <p>Known for his solid commitment to professional standards, Mr. Aakash Agarwal heads the Sales, Marketing, Design & Development, Accounts, Administration and Information Technology departments at Krisala Developers. His contributions have been remarkable and have proven to be the catalyst in the growth of Krisala Developers, by going from 8 homes to 9000+ homes delivered. It is only under his able leadership that Krisala has reached various milestones within just 15 years. His vision for 2026-27 speaks in numbers: he aims to connect with 4100+ new customers.</p>            <div class="social">
